#~ "exploratory, suboptimal matches — unless you seed initial ratings by "
#~ "hand. Once ratings settle, the tension mostly dissolves: the same "
#~ "strategy can hold the best match quality in the field while converging as "
#~ "fast as anything else."
#~ msgstr ""
